---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Gutter Cleaning in Woodbridge, VA | Same-Day Service" description="Professional gutter cleaning in Woodbridge, VA. Remove leaves, debris, and blockages. Same-day service, upfront pricing. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Gutter Cleaning</div>
      <h1>Gutter Cleaning in Woodbridge, VA</h1>
      <p>Thorough removal of leaves, needles, and debris so water flows freely and your foundation stays protected.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why Regular Gutter Cleaning Matters</h2>
      <p>Woodbridge homes face heavy leaf fall from oaks, maples, and pines. Clogged gutters overflow, stain siding, and direct water toward the foundation. Our crew removes debris, flushes downspouts, and checks for early signs of damage.</p>
      <h2>What’s Included</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full gutter trough cleaning by hand and tools</li>
        <li>Downspout flushing to restore flow</li>
        <li>Visual inspection of hangers, seams, and fascia</li>
        <li>Debris haul-away — we leave the property clean</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Typical Pricing</h2>
      <p>Single-story homes often start from $149. Two-story and complex roofs are quoted on-site. You receive a clear price before work begins.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay} for Cleaning</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
